{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "3ff22083-135a-4fb7-9eec-50e343d55c86",
    "name": "Parking · spot-service",
    "description": "spot-service — verificado contra `release` el 2026-07-27.\n\nTodos los endpoints de `SpotRestAdapter` estan implementados. Base path `/v1/spots`.\n\nTipos validos de `type`: `CAR`, `CAR_PMR`, `MOTORBIKE`.\nEstados de `status` en la respuesta: `AVAILABLE`, `OCCUPIED`, `UNAVAILABLE`.\n\nAvisos sobre el contrato:\n- `PATCH /{id}/status` **no cambia el estado**: recibe `SpotRequest` (campo\n  `type`) y delega en `UpdateSpotUseCase`, o sea que actualiza el TIPO. El nombre\n  de la ruta engaña. Para liberar una plaza usa `POST /{id}/release`.\n- `POST /occupy` recibe `SpotRequest` (`{\"type\": ...}`) y devuelve `SpotResponse`\n  (`id`/`type`/`status`). Las clases `SpotOccupyRequest` (`vehicleType`) y\n  `SpotOccupyResponse` (`spotId`/`numSpot`) existen en el repo pero **no las usa\n  ningun endpoint**: son codigo muerto, no el contrato real.\n- `GET /v1/spots/availability` del openapi.yml no existe.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Crear plaza",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "spots"
          ]
        },
        "description": "POST /v1/spots -> 201 Created. Body: `{\"type\": \"CAR\"}`.\n\nGuarda el id en `spotId`.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.environment.set('spotId', body.id);",
              "pm.test('nace AVAILABLE', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('AVAILABLE'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Listar plazas",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "spots"
          ]
        },
        "description": "GET /v1/spots -> 200 con todas las plazas."
