    {
      "name": "Ocupar plaza (RN-01)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots/occupy",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "spots",
            "occupy"
          ]
        },
        "description": "POST /v1/spots/occupy -> 200 con la plaza asignada.\n\nBody: `{\"type\": \"CAR\"}` (campo `type`, NO `vehicleType`).\n\nEs el endpoint que stay-service necesita en el check-in. Si no queda ninguna plaza libre de ese tipo, aqui se materializa **RN-01 (parking completo)**.\n\n> Ojo: `StaySpotClientAdapter.occupySpot` llama a esta ruta con **PATCH**, no con POST -> hoy recibe 405 y el check-in nunca ocupa plaza. Ver README, seccion 'Bugs conocidos'.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"{{vehicleType}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.environment.set('spotId', body.id);",
              "pm.test('queda OCCUPIED', () => pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('OCCUPIED'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Liberar plaza",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrlSpot}}/v1/spots/{{spotId}}/release",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrlSpot}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "spots",
            "{{spotId}}",
            "release"
          ]
        },
        "description": "POST /v1/spots/{id}/release -> 200. Sin body.\n\nEs la compensacion que ejecuta el check-in (IN-25) si falla al guardar la estancia despues de haber ocupado la plaza."
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('vuelve a AVAILABLE', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('AVAILABLE'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
